*January 23rd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[kane]]. <ref name="-kane">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2014760083121492086|title=Our journey with Mykhailo "Kane" Blahin has come to an end|date=2026-01-23|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 8th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench and transfer-list [[Flierax]]. <ref name="Flierax bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2030592091223445616|title=Changes are part of every team’s journey|date=2026-03-08|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 14th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' sign [[headtr1ck]]. <ref name="+headtr1ck">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2032789406914937075|title=Look who we got here|date=2026-03-14|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
